<title>USA: Midwest Express' Skyway adds service.</title>
<headline>Midwest Express' Skyway adds service.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Midwest Express Holdings Inc said its Skyway Airlines, beginning June 15, will introduce six nonstop flights between Milwaukee and Marquette, Mich., each weekday.</p>
<p>Skyway also will add two nonstop flights between Milwaukee and Lansing, Mich., and also between Milwaukee and Cincinnati, on weekdays, increasing the total number of flights between each of the two cities to six daily.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
